        "identifier": [
          "0802-09-3691"
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "@value": "Gustav Deutsch filmt sein Schlafzimmer 48 Stunden lang. Die 8mm-Kamera nimmt etwa alle 5 Minuten ein Bild auf. Es entsteht eine geraffte Aufnahme der vergehenden Zeit. (Text: Hanna Schimek/Anna Högner)",
            "@language": "de"
          },
          {
            "@value": "Gustav Deutsch filmed his bedroom over the course of 48 hours. His 8mm camera took a picture approximately every five minutes. The result is a condensed recording of the passing of time. (Text: Hanna Schimek/Anna Högner)",
            "@language": "en"
          }
        ]
